/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 146 0 R
/E (This section includes all the required header files and defines constants for the program. A hashing function is implemented to convert passwords into secure hash values. Passwords are never stored in plain text, improving system security. These functions form the foundation of secure authentication in the project.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
