/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 148 0 R
/E (This part of the code handles the main login authentication process. It compares the entered username and hashed password with stored credentials. The system allows a maximum of three login attempts, displaying remaining attempts each time. After three failed attempts, the system gets locked and triggers the forgot password option.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
