/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 149 0 R
/E (This code verifies the registered mobile number before allowing password recovery. A random OTP is generated using rand\(\) and displayed for verification. The user must enter the correct OTP to proceed further. Incorrect OTP or unregistered mobile number terminates the reset process.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
