/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 150 0 R
/E (This part of the code handles the Forgot Password logic after the system is locked. It verifies the registered mobile number and generates a One-Time Password \(OTP\). Only when the correct OTP is entered, the user is allowed to reset the password securely. After password reset, the system redirects the user to login again for authentication.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
